---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = "August 2026";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Cookie Policy"
  description="How Pixelquil uses cookies, including those set by Google AdSense."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand-600">
      Cookie Policy
    </span>
    <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">What are cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Cookies are small text files stored on your device by your browser, commonly used to
          remember preferences or track visits across sites.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Cookies Pixelquil sets directly</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Pixelquil's own tools do not set cookies to track you. Tools run locally in your browser
          and do not require session cookies to function.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Third-party cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          If Google AdSense advertising is active on this site, Google and its advertising
          partners may set cookies to serve ads, including personalized ads based on your prior
          browsing. This is governed by Google's own policies, not Pixelquil's. You can review or
          opt out of personalized advertising at
          <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Ads Settings</a>,
          and learn more about how Google uses data at
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Partner Sites policy</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Managing cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Most browsers let you block or delete cookies through their settings. Doing so may
          affect how ads are displayed but will not affect the functionality of any Pixelquil
          tool, since tools do not depend on cookies to work.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Questions</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Questions about this policy can be sent through our
          <a href="/contact/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>